                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            From form to PDF in under 60 seconds. No loading screens, no processing delays.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">📄 Instant PDF Download</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            One click and your invoice is ready – download immediately, no email verification required.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">🚫 No Signup Required</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Zero barriers. No email, no password, no account creation – just open and use.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">📱 Works on Any Device</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Create invoices instantly from your phone, tablet, or laptop – perfect for on‑the‑go billing.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">💼 Professional Design</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Clean, modern invoice layout that impresses your clients – no watermarks, no ads.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">🔄 Unlimited Use</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Generate as many instant invoices as you want – always free, always instant.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">When You Need an Invoice Right Now</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    Clients ask for an invoice while you're on the phone? Need to bill a last‑minute job? Forgot to send an invoice before the weekend? RatPDF's instant invoice generator is your solution – no delays, no excuses.
                </p>

                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    Just fill in your business name, client details, add line items, set tax if needed, and click "Generate PDF". Your professional invoice appears instantly – ready to email, print, or send via WhatsApp.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2">⚡ Average invoice creation time: under 60 seconds</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">📄 No watermarks or branding – completely clean PDF</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">🔒 No data stored – your information stays with you</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">🌍 Works worldwide – any currency, any tax rate</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">🎯 Perfect for freelancers, contractors, and small businesses</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
                <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-4 p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">Stop Waiting – Start Invoicing Instantly</h3>

                    <p class="mb-4">
                        No signup, no credit card, no hidden tricks. Just fast, free invoices.
                    </p>

                    <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-semibold">
                        Generate Invoice Instantly
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        How instant is "instant"?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        From the moment you click "Generate PDF", your invoice is created and downloaded in less than 2 seconds. The whole process – filling the form and downloading – typically takes under a minute.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Do I need to create an account?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account, no email, no password. Just open the page and start creating. We don't store any of your data, so there's nothing to sign up for.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Are the PDF invoices watermarked?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No watermarks, no "trial version" stamps, no advertisements. You get a clean, professional invoice that represents your business.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Can I add my logo and business details?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. You can enter your business name, address, logo URL, tax ID, and payment terms – all will appear on the generated invoice.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Is this really free?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        100% free. No hidden fees, no premium tiers, no credit card required. We believe invoicing should be simple and accessible to everyone.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Get Your Invoice in Seconds – Not Hours</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
            Stop wrestling with complicated software. Generate an instant PDF invoice now.
        </p>

